silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_r1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.03_gossip_colimit_diagram.concrete_anchor.r1" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_r1 silm:hasLongDescription "The MorningReadingReplica is R_1 is the morning vet-visit replica for Mittens — contains the vaccination record and morning weight. It contributes via mu_1 to R_vee and via nu_1 to VetCarePlan_77. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'R_1', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_r_vee a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.03_gossip_colimit_diagram.concrete_anchor.r_vee" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_r_vee silm:hasLongDescription "The FullyConvergedVetRecordForMittens is R_vee is the fully converged vet record state for Mittens — contains all health readings (morning weight, afternoon temperature, evening microchip scan) from all replicas. This is the colimit colim D_gossip. Every other compatible aggregation of R_1 and R_2 must factor through R_vee via the unique mediating arrow u." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_r2 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.03_gossip_colimit_diagram.concrete_anchor.r2" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_r2 silm:hasLongDescription "The AfternoonReadingReplica is R_2 is the afternoon vet-visit replica for Mittens — contains the temperature reading and afternoon weight. It contributes via mu_2 to R_vee and via nu_2 to VetCarePlan_77. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'R_2', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_vet_care_plan a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.03_gossip_colimit_diagram.concrete_anchor.vet_care_plan" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_03_gossip_colimit_diagram_concrete_anchor_vet_care_plan silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensClinicalSummaryPlan77 is VetCarePlan_77 is the clinical summary that incorporates both health readings — the vet's care plan document that aggregates all of Mittens's measurements. It is the target of the compatible cocone nu_i. The universal property says: any system that correctly aggregates R_1 and R_2 into a clinical summary must factor through R_vee, because R_vee is the canonical convergence point." .
